# Purpose: Allowlist build context for the routing image - only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Version: v1 (2026-09-24)
# Scope: PRODUCTION - read by docker build (CI).
# Architecture: hylas-routing; keeps config/ (crew roster, float plan), var/, .venv,
#   node_modules and every stray file out of the image by ignoring EVERYTHING first.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!data/
!backend/
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
